#: inc/admin-help-page.php:144
msgid "Help"
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-help-page.php:179
msgid "How to do the things this plugin is for. Every screen also has a Help tab at the top right, which explains what the screen means rather than how to use it."
msgstr ""

#: inc/admin-help-page.php:190
